#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade from the Open Plan"
msgstr "Mag-upgrade mula sa Open Plan"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade from the Open Plan {#upgrade-from-the-open-plan}"
msgstr "Mag-upgrade mula sa Open Plan {#upgrade-from-the-open-plan}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide is for entities who want to upgrade from the IBM Quantum&reg; "
"Open Plan to an IBM Cloud&reg; Pay-As-You-Go Plan. For instructions to set "
"up a cloud account, set up a service instance, and work with users, follow "
"these steps.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang gabay na ito ay para sa mga entity na gustong mag-upgrade mula sa IBM "
"Quantum&reg; Open Plan patungo sa IBM Cloud&reg; Pay-As-You-Go Plan. Para sa"
" mga tagubilin sa pag-set up ng cloud account, pag-set up ng service "
"instance, at pakikipagtulungan sa mga user, sundin ang mga hakbang na ito.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you are an individual setting up the service for the first time or if you"
" have been invited to an instance by an administrator, follow the steps in "
"[Install Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit) instead.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung ikaw ay isang indibidwal na nag-se-set up ng serbisyo sa unang "
"pagkakataon, o kung inimbitahan ka ng isang administrator sa isang instance,"
" sundin na lang ang mga hakbang sa [I-install ang Qiskit](/guides/install-"
"qiskit).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin {#before-you-begin}"
msgstr "Bago ka magsimula {#before-you-begin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If necessary, follow the steps in the [Set up to use IBM "
"Cloud](/guides/cloud-setup#cloud) section to complete the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung kinakailangan, sundin ang mga hakbang sa seksyong [I-set up para "
"gamitin ang IBM Cloud](/guides/cloud-setup#cloud) para makumpleto ang "
"sumusunod:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Sign up for an IBM Cloud account.\n"
msgstr "Mag-sign up para sa IBM Cloud account.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Create an IBM Quantum instance.\n"
msgstr "Gumawa ng IBM Quantum instance.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"update-cloud-account\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"update-cloud-account\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade your IBM Cloud account {#upgrade-your-ibm-cloud-account}"
msgstr ""
"I-upgrade ang iyong IBM Cloud account {#upgrade-your-ibm-cloud-account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Skip this if you already have an IBM Cloud Pay-as-you-go account. All new "
"IBM Cloud accounts are set up as Pay-as-you-go.\n"
msgstr ""
"Laktawan ito kung mayroon ka nang IBM Cloud Pay-as-you-go account. Lahat ng "
"bagong IBM Cloud account ay naka-set up bilang Pay-as-you-go.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You must upgrade your IBM Cloud account in the following circumstances:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kailangan mong i-upgrade ang iyong IBM Cloud account sa mga sumusunod na "
"sitwasyon:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "You have a Trial account.\n"
msgstr "Mayroon kang Trial account.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You have a Lite account (deprecated) that you created before 25 October "
"2021.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mayroon kang Lite account (deprecated) na ginawa mo bago ang 25 Oktubre "
"2021.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After you upgrade, you can continue to use any instances that you created "
"with your Lite account. To upgrade to a Pay-As-You-Go account, complete the "
"following steps:\n"
msgstr ""
"Pagkatapos mo mag-upgrade, maaari mo pa ring gamitin ang anumang instance na"
" ginawa mo gamit ang iyong Lite account. Para mag-upgrade sa Pay-As-You-Go "
"account, kumpletuhin ang mga sumusunod na hakbang:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Go to Manage > [Account](https://cloud.ibm.com/account) in the IBM Cloud "
"console.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pumunta sa Manage > [Account](https://cloud.ibm.com/account) sa IBM Cloud "
"console.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Select **Account settings**, and click **Add credit card**.\n"
msgstr "Piliin ang **Account settings**, at i-click ang **Add credit card**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Enter your payment information and click **Next** to submit your "
"information.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ilagay ang iyong impormasyon sa pagbabayad at i-click ang **Next** para "
"isumite ang iyong impormasyon.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After your payment information is processed, your account is upgraded.\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"You will not be charged unless you create a Pay-As-You-Go Plan instance and use it to send workloads to QPUs.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Pagkatapos maproseso ang iyong impormasyon sa pagbabayad, maa-upgrade na ang iyong account.\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Hindi ka sisingilin maliban kung gumawa ka ng Pay-As-You-Go Plan instance at gamitin ito para magpadala ng mga workload sa mga QPU.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Access your Pay-As-You-Go Plan {#access-your-pay-as-you-go-plan}"
msgstr ""
"I-access ang iyong Pay-As-You-Go Plan {#access-your-pay-as-you-go-plan}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To use your IBM Cloud Pay-As-You-Go Plan, create a new "
"[instance](/guides/instances) and assign it to the Pay-As-You-Go Plan.  "
"<ins>All jobs sent to QPUs by specifying this instance will incur a "
"cost.</ins>  To use QPUs without incurring a cost, you must use an instance "
"assigned to the Open plan or other free plan, if you have one.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para gamitin ang iyong IBM Cloud Pay-As-You-Go Plan, gumawa ng bagong "
"[instance](/guides/instances) at italaga ito sa Pay-As-You-Go Plan.  "
"<ins>Lahat ng mga job na ipinadala sa mga QPU sa pamamagitan ng pagtukoy sa "
"instance na ito ay may kasamang bayad.</ins>  Para gumamit ng mga QPU nang "
"walang bayad, kailangan mong gumamit ng instance na nakatalaga sa Open plan "
"o ibang libreng plan, kung mayroon kang ganoon.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"It is recommended that you set up a [cost limit](/guides/manage-cost#cost-"
"limit) on the instance and learn about other ways to manage your cost when "
"using the Pay-As-You-Go Plan.\n"
msgstr ""
"Inirerekomenda na mag-set up ka ng [cost limit](/guides/manage-cost#cost-"
"limit) sa instance at alamin ang iba pang paraan para pamahalaan ang iyong "
"gastos kapag gumagamit ng Pay-As-You-Go Plan.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Mga susunod na hakbang {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  -  [Manage cost](/guides/manage-cost) when using the Pay-As-You-Go Plan.\n"
"  -  Learn about the available [plans](/guides/plans-overview).\n"
"  -  Follow the steps in the [Run your first circuit on hardware](/guides/hello-world) guide to write and run a quantum program.\n"
"  -  Try a [tutorial](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Mga rekomendasyon\">\n"
"  -  [Pamahalaan ang gastos](/guides/manage-cost) kapag gumagamit ng Pay-As-You-Go Plan.\n"
"  -  Alamin ang mga available na [plan](/guides/plans-overview).\n"
"  -  Sundin ang mga hakbang sa gabay na [I-run ang iyong unang circuit sa hardware](/guides/hello-world) para sumulat at magpatakbo ng quantum program.\n"
"  -  Subukan ang isang [tutorial](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
